OL,3,GNEWSAShould park and ride return to
OL,4,AWorcester?
OL,5,
OL,6,FShould Worcester get its park and ride
OL,7,Fservice back?
OL,9,FYes, says the leader of Worcestershire
OL,10,FCounty Council - 12 years after it was
OL,11,Fcontroversially axed.
OL,13,FGreen councillor Matt Jenkins said it
OL,14,Fhad been a "mistake" for Worcester to
OL,15,Fhave scrapped the service back in 2014,
OL,16,Fand believed it could help ease
OL,17,Fcongestion.
OL,19,FHe told the BBC it should be revisited
OL,20,Fonce a reorganisation of local
OL,21,Fgovernment is finalised.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
